cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these Galaxy tools, please cite the EWASGalaxy suite they extend
  and this repository.
title: "EWAS cross-array harmonisation: Galaxy tool suite"
abstract: >-
  Galaxy wrappers for cross-array harmonisation of Illumina 450K and
  MethylationEPIC data and for design-aware region and block detection in
  longitudinal EWAS, extending the EWASGalaxy tool suite.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/bioinfbrad/ewas-crossarray-harmonise
authors:
